# Local env & secrets — never bake into images (S-189 hotspot hardening)
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

# VCS / local tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Python caches / local virtualenvs
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.coverage
**/coverage/
**/htmlcov/
**/.tox/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Node / Next.js local artifacts (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Dev notes & OS junk
WORKLOG.md
**/.DS_Store
